---
import Layout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';import {href} from '../lib/site';
---
<Layout title="月光音乐馆"><section class="inner-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE LISTENING ROOM / 02</p><h1>把时间，<br/><em>调慢半拍。</em></h1><p>一首歌的时间，只属于此刻。</p></section><section class="listening-room wrap"><div class="turntable" data-reveal><div class="vinyl" data-vinyl><img src={href('art/moon-observatory-mobile.webp')} alt="月面唱片封面"/><i></i></div><div class="tonearm" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="rpm">33⅓ RPM · MOONLIGHT RECORDS</span></div><div class="track-list" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">ORIGINAL SESSIONS</p><h2 data-track-title>月沿散步</h2><p>两首本站原创合成短曲</p><button class="track" data-track="0"><span>01</span><b>月沿散步<small>MOONWALK / 00:49</small></b><span>▷</span></button><button class="track" data-track="1"><span>02</span><b>星间来信<small>STARLIT LETTER / 00:43</small></b><span>▷</span></button><label class="music-progress">播放进度<input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" value="0" data-seek aria-label="音乐播放进度"/></label><label class="music-volume">音量<input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.6" data-volume aria-label="音量"/></label><label class="local-music">＋ 播放设备中的歌曲<input type="file" accept="audio/*" data-local-audio/></label><small>所选文件仅在当前浏览器播放，不上传。</small></div></section></Layout>
